<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Safe in the arms of Jesus,</l><l>Safe from corroding care,</l><l>Safe from the world’s temptations,</l><l>Sin cannot harm me there.</l><l>Free from the blight of sorrow,</l><l>Free from my doubts and fears;</l><l>Only a few more trials,</l><l>Only a few more tears.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus, my heart’s dear Refuge,</l><l>Jesus has died for me;</l><l>Firm on the Rock of Ages</l><l>Ever my trust shall be.</l><l>Here let me wait with patience,</l><l>Wait till the night is o’er,</l><l>Wait till I see the morning</l><l>Break on the golden shore.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
